"blue" = #004FFF
"orange" = #FF6300
"Null placeholder" = Roboto font, font size 12px. line height 20px, weight 300 on all responsive screen widths
Use Tailwind classes for new styling (consistent, maintainable, responsive), prefer inline styles only when necessary for dynamic values or custom styling explicitly set or asked for, Never use both conflicting approaches on the same property.
When adding box shadows and text shadows to elements, only add it to the element- never hardcode it into the CSS class.
